[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3120.549, "timestamp": "00:52:00", "text": "送料など全て含めて。ええ、売ります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3122.87, "timestamp": "00:52:02", "text": "安く手に入れる。 10ルピーで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3124.87, "timestamp": "00:52:04", "text": "何かみたいに。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3125.719, "timestamp": "00:52:05", "author": "@RylanGoldman", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lBG4Q2j7htJbxg-phr_qVcAKlNOGbhJhWBe0SkBAuX3EdiRFA_mJUmpSD86gxTbRG5GQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you make music right"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3128.549, "timestamp": "00:52:08", "text": "格安で売りますよ。実は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3130.47, "timestamp": "00:52:10", "text": "あなたは音楽を作っているんですよね？私は手に入れなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3133.27, "timestamp": "00:52:13", "text": "音楽制作に復帰する。私は学ばなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3136.79, "timestamp": "00:52:16", "text": "BAの非常に基本的なことからもう一度。私はそうします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3140.069, "timestamp": "00:52:20", "text": "それらのストリームはまもなく。すぐに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3142.069, "timestamp": "00:52:22", "text": "これらのウェブサイト関連の後には、これらすべて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3145.99, "timestamp": "00:52:25", "text": "今はもう終わった。私は考えている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3148.71, "timestamp": "00:52:28", "text": "主にそれを行うこと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3151.03, "timestamp": "00:52:31", "text": "また、時折ゲーム配信も行われ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3157.43, "timestamp": "00:52:37", "text": "私は今、自分にとって最善の方法を考えています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3160.47, "timestamp": "00:52:40", "text": "お金を稼いでモデルになって支払う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3163.43, "timestamp": "00:52:43", "text": "私の芸術家としてのこだわりや厳しさなどについて。いいえ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3166.79, "timestamp": "00:52:46", "text": "2,000ドルは本当に大金なので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3170.47, "timestamp": "00:52:50", "text": "グッズを売ってみようかなと考えていた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3173.03, "timestamp": "00:52:53", "text": "よし、グッズを売って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3177.67, "